sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker Poll Cycle
    participant SAPI as Sportsbook API
    participant DB as Persistence Stores
    participant KAPI as Kalshi API
    participant CEL as Canonical Alignment
    participant SC as Signal Compute
    participant OUT as Outputs

    W->>SAPI: Fetch legacy snapshots
    SAPI-->>W: Return snapshots
    W->>DB: Persist snapshots
    W->>KAPI: Fetch exchange states
    KAPI-->>W: Return exchange states
    W->>DB: Persist quote events
    W->>CEL: Load alignments
    CEL-->>W: Aligned event contexts
    W->>SC: Compute signals (movement, divergence, skew)
    SC-->>W: Generated signals
    W->>DB: Persist signals
    W->>OUT: Emit to UI, API, Discord, MCP
